WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.256
Welcome to the last chapter of
Building Global Secure Access,

2
00:00:04.256 --> 00:00:07.225
Chapter 9: deploying to
test and production.

3
00:00:07.225 --> 00:00:10.837
The labs proved the code on
fixtures and in a test tenant.

4
00:00:10.837 --> 00:00:15.341
This runbook moves the rollout itself:
one ring at a time, logs first,

5
00:00:15.341 --> 00:00:20.173
emergency access checked before
anything changes, every change from a

6
00:00:20.173 --> 00:00:24.676
plan a second person approved, and
a go or no-go from measured values.

7
00:00:24.676 --> 00:00:27.798
It hasn't been run against a live tenant;

8
00:00:27.798 --> 00:00:33.310
the output you'll see is the kit's
fixture mode, run on November 17, 2026.
